      "description": "Kasia Nova is a rounded little buddy with proportions just condensed enough to squeeze loads of charm into every word. It is cheerful, clear, and uncomplicated.\n\nPerfect for wildest, sugar-fueled design worlds—children’s products, video games, mobile apps, snacks, tees, magazines, restaurants—it’s built to make your projects lighthearted while not collapsing under the weight of bad typography.\n\nKasia Nova teams up with Tosia Nova and Pusia Nova, forming a versatile superfamily of sans-serif fonts ready to tackle any design challenge.",
